Saves tab in the F1 panel, one VU1 miss capture per micro-memory image, quieter logs.
F1 > Saves copies the memory card (GOW_MC0) to GOW_SAVES_DIR/<date>-<time>/Mcd001.ps2 + save.json; the launcher restores it.
GOW_VU1_CAPTURE_MISSES writes miss_<image hash>.bin once per image instead of block_<key>.bin per missing block.
[gow-pad2] read lines only with GOW_PAD_LOG; the DMA SPR-flag warning skips cnt/ret/end tags, which never read ADDR.

